いる。もし二人を一緒に描いていただけたら、とても嬉しいです。設定は問いません。自由に描いてください。ご検討いただき誠にありがとうございます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sobakonattou07/works/1155", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7847e4d2/uploads/origins/48e58392-00c6-47b5-ac91-dd7dad8f9779?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebb810ba12b9deb3278c3184e1cc174e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7847e4d2/uploads/origins/48e58392-00c6-47b5-ac91-dd7dad8f9779?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebb810ba12b9deb3278c3184e1cc174e, https://si.imgix.net/7847e4d2/uploads/origins/48e58392-00c6-47b5-ac91-dd7dad8f9779?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=daa10ec3278bba25a3505b8061e843de 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7847e4d2/uploads/origins/48e58392-00c6-47b5-ac91-dd7dad8f9779?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9aad374fd44af5199961d99d225c9939 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1m6mNz5wvs2xnqUCs4pSKFnkdYMUXOOaG?usp=sharing\n\nご自由にお願い致します！＾ー＾", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sobakonattou07/works/1154", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fa90922a/uploads/origins/ba51a1be-28db-4f7a-922e-514865a5502c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=476127ace790e23d58a3b22b6c53aa6d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fa90922a/uploads/origins/ba51a1be-28db-4f7a-922e-514865a5502c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=476127ace790e23d58a3b22b6c53aa6d, https://si.imgix.net/fa90922a/uploads/origins/ba51a1be-28db-4f7a-922e-514865a5502c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15e76429ff8d4a486ddb73ce270e2638 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fa90922a/uploads/origins/ba51a1be-28db-4f7a-922e-514865a5502c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10ae533279028db44a7cb53